DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: so sisira na po yung ating mga naplano po na dapat bilhin.

asr-001055
01:00:27.680 --> 01:00:34.640
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: Okay, so nagkakapatong-patong minsan sa isang taon na meron yung na out of stock

asr-001056
01:00:34.640 --> 01:00:38.220
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: kasi hindi nga nabili, yung na-forecast na kailangan,

asr-001057
01:00:38.580 --> 01:00:43.580
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: or kung doon sa susunod na taon nabili, nagpapatong-patong po.

asr-001058
01:00:43.940 --> 01:00:48.760
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: Tapos kung hindi rin po maayos yung ating inventory system

asr-001059
01:00:48.760 --> 01:00:53.680
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: na hindi po nakikita yung kung ano yung actual na doon sa baba.

asr-001060
01:00:53.680 --> 01:00:57.680
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Parang, ayoko po mapakinggan kasi parang pambubunan.

asr-001061
01:00:57.680 --> 01:01:01.720
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Hindi po, I'll tell it to the Marines, ika nga, baka sabihin nyo sa pagong.

asr-001062
01:01:02.900 --> 01:01:05.720
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Napakatagal na po every year, hindi nyo pa rin po ma-perfect yung system.

asr-001063
01:01:05.960 --> 01:01:09.840
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At saka yung sinasabi nyo, hindi na po forecast, hindi na po plano, hindi po wrong.

asr-001064
01:01:10.300 --> 01:01:11.740
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Tinatambak nyo lang po sa warehouse.

asr-001065
01:01:12.560 --> 01:01:16.600
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi nga po, bumibili kayo ng mga gamot na about to expire.

asr-001066
01:01:17.420 --> 01:01:21.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sandali lang po, about to expire dahil meron kayong pinapaboran na supplier

asr-001067
01:01:21.640 --> 01:01:24.000
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: at yung mga supplier na yun, nagbibigay po ng kickback.

asr-001068
01:01:24.960 --> 01:01:26.620
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Tinatambak po dyan sa warehouse.

asr-001069
01:01:27.680 --> 01:01:29.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Every year, kasi yung mga sinasabi nyo po ma'am,

asr-001070
01:01:30.500 --> 01:01:35.660
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: okay, sige, tanggapin ko yan for the first year, for the second year, pwede pa,

asr-001071
01:01:35.780 --> 01:01:39.960
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: pero third, fourth, fifth year, sixth year, ganoon pa rin, come on.

asr-001072
01:01:40.420 --> 01:01:41.120
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Nagluloko na tayo.

asr-001073
01:01:41.260 --> 01:01:45.680
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Tapos, sinasabi nyo pa na yung gamot na nag-expire, binabalik niyo supplier.

asr-001074
01:01:47.080 --> 01:01:50.240
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At yung supplier nagbibigay ng bagong gamot.

asr-001075
01:01:50.420 --> 01:01:51.320
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Nasaan ang resibo?

asr-001076
01:01:51.900 --> 01:01:52.340
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Show us.

asr-001077
01:01:53.200 --> 01:01:56.560
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: Yun pong, hindi po ako version of ang sabi nyo.

asr-001078
01:01:56.660 --> 01:01:57.240
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pakisagot lang po.

asr-001079
01:01:57.240 --> 01:02:00.240
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Meron pa kayo may pakitang resibo na yung mga expired na gamot.

asr-001080
01:02:00.340 --> 01:02:03.820
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sinasabi nyo doon sa tuwing hearing na tinatanong ko sa inyo na ibinabalik yung supplier.

asr-001081
01:02:04.400 --> 01:02:06.240
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At that yung supplier, pinapalit ka ng bago.

asr-001082
01:02:06.560 --> 01:02:08.720
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And is that stipulated po yung sa contract?

asr-001083
01:02:09.180 --> 01:02:12.220
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: Sir, yung pong binabalik, kasi meron pong kwano eh.

asr-001084
01:02:12.440 --> 01:02:18.320
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: Pag bumibili kami yung gamot, dapat upon delivery, 18 months yung shelf life niya.

asr-001085
01:02:18.680 --> 01:02:18.900
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: Okay.

asr-001086
01:02:19.260 --> 01:02:24.860
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: Ngayon, minsan po, kasi for several reasons, medyo bumababa doon sa 18 months.

asr-001087
01:02:24.860 --> 01:02:26.860
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: Sabihin na nyo natin, 15 months upon delivery.

asr-001088
01:02:27.240 --> 01:02:37.600
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: At tinatanggap po yun, pero meron pong parang guarantee letter po na kinukuha from the supplier na kapag near 6 months na po siya papalitan.

asr-001089
01:02:37.600 --> 01:02:38.280
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ma'am, sorry ma'am.

asr-001090
01:02:38.400 --> 01:02:41.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: I've heard that so many times.

asr-001091
01:02:41.320 --> 01:02:42.600
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Umulit-ulit na lang tayo.

asr-001092
01:02:43.240 --> 01:02:54.340
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Doon na lang po tayo sa nag-expired na gamot na prinami sa amin, sinabi sa akin, ilang beses sa hearing dito, maging doon sa plenary, na isinosolidaw yun.

asr-001093
01:02:54.340 --> 01:02:55.800
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Huwag kayong mag-alalasin.

asr-001094
01:02:55.800 --> 01:03:02.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Dahil yung mga gamot na nag-expired, hindi naman tayo lugi dyan dahil sinusolid po namin yan at pinapalitan naman po yan.

asr-001095
01:03:02.460 --> 01:03:06.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Nasaan po yung mga dokumento? Huwag naman kayong magpaliwanag. Nagpapaikot-ikot lang tayo rito.

asr-001096
01:03:06.560 --> 01:03:07.080
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Opo, pasensya naman po.

asr-001097
01:03:07.080 --> 01:03:15.300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Nasaan ang resibo na yun ay sinuli, yung mga nag-expired na sinasabi nyo by the hundreds of millions na pinapalitan?

asr-001098
01:03:16.380 --> 01:03:19.160
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: Okay. Maybe we can request yung...

asr-001099
01:03:19.160 --> 01:03:20.000
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: I need the receipts.

asr-001100
01:03:20.000 --> 01:03:22.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: I need the receipts. Give this committee a resibo.

asr-001101
01:03:22.280 --> 01:03:22.580
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: Opo.

asr-001102
01:03:22.580 --> 01:03:25.480
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At saka tingnan natin yung contract right now. Give us the contract.

asr-001103
01:03:25.800 --> 01:03:29.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: I-stipulate ba doon na ibabalik yung mga na-expired? Does it say there?

asr-001104
01:03:34.000 --> 01:03:45.660
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: Hindi po ako aware doon sa ibinabalik na nag-expired. Yun lang pong near expiry ang alam po namin na nasa TOR na kailangan po nilang palitan bago mag-expired.

asr-001105
01:03:45.860 --> 01:03:49.480
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: Pero yung expired, hindi po kami aware namin.

asr-001106
01:03:49.480 --> 01:03:53.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sinabi po yun na yung nag-expired. Huwag daw mag-alala.

asr-001107
01:03:53.660 --> 01:03:55.780
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And then ma'am, Secretary?

asr-001108
01:03:55.800 --> 01:04:07.180
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Secretary Mercado, I hope under your watch, hindi na mangyari ito. Okay lang siguro kung 1 million, 2 million, 10 million, pero hundreds of millions.

asr-001109
01:04:08.840 --> 01:04:19.100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: But nababasura lang, nababaon lang sa lupa. Billions pa this year. Ilan po ang nag-expired, Secretary Mercado, itong 2026?

asr-001110
01:04:20.300 --> 01:04:24.360
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Magkano pong halaga ng nag-expired na binauna naman sa lupa?

asr-001111
01:04:27.210 --> 01:04:33.850
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Magkakalagay po dito sa aking data spot. For 2025, expired stocks were about 217 million.

asr-001112
01:04:34.170 --> 01:04:36.550
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: And the near expiry is 477 million.

asr-001113
01:04:36.870 --> 01:04:43.800
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Yan na naman yung pera ng taong bahay na nasayang na ibinaon sa lupa. Hindi po ba?

asr-001114
01:04:44.880 --> 01:04:50.180
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At huwag nyo na pong sabihin sa amin ngayon, dahil mag-iinit lang ulo namin na yun po ibinabalik.

asr-001115
01:04:50.800 --> 01:04:52.660
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Hindi po, yan po ibinabasura.

asr-001116
01:04:53.220 --> 01:04:57.720
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ayun ang may ebidensya. Kung gusto nyo, pumunta tayo sa Tala. Maghukay tayo doon. Andoon.

asr-001117
01:04:59.100 --> 01:05:05.940
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Baka sa compound na yun, punong-puno ng mga nababaon na gamot. Dapat meron pong managot dito.

asr-001118
01:05:07.600 --> 01:05:08.840
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Dapat hindi na po ito maulit.

asr-001119
01:05:09.280 --> 01:05:15.800
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So can you guarantee us na meron kayong pag-iisipang sistema na maayos?

asr-001120
01:05:15.960 --> 01:05:19.760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi antagal na eh, di ba? Na hindi na tayo magkaka-expire na gamot.

asr-001121
01:05:19.840 --> 01:05:21.280
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sa ibang bansa, it doesn't happen.

asr-001122
01:05:22.420 --> 01:05:24.980
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Hindi nangyari ito. Sinignan ko, Singapore, wala.

asr-001123
01:05:24.980 --> 01:05:34.600
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Nag-expire Singapore, pero yung mga outdated ng mga gamot, halimbawa COVID, naubos na, tapos na, o din-dispose of nila.

asr-001124
01:05:34.700 --> 01:05:39.340
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pero hindi by the hundreds of millions. One million Singapore dollars, ganun lang.

asr-001125
01:05:40.180 --> 01:05:43.040
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sa atin, hundreds of millions and billions pa.

asr-001126
01:05:45.230 --> 01:05:47.190
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So talagang very clear, may corruption po dito.

asr-001127
01:05:48.750 --> 01:05:50.590
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Siguro, maganda yung blue ribbon to.

asr-001128
01:05:51.890 --> 01:05:53.830
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Because it's been happening every year.

asr-001129
01:05:53.830 --> 01:05:57.590
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Siguro, Senping, i-blue ribbon po siguro natin to.

asr-001130
01:05:57.930 --> 01:06:04.110
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Mr. Chairman, with the indulgence of, with the permission of Sen. Tulfo, can we go back further in time, ano?

asr-001131
01:06:04.950 --> 01:06:14.630
Senator Panfilo Lacson: 2024, 2023, 2022, kung meron kayong datas, magkano pa yung yearly na nag-expire na tinatapo natin?

asr-001132
01:06:15.150 --> 01:06:17.210
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Para na ma-appreciate namin better.

asr-001134
01:06:22.280 --> 01:06:24.880
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Eto, Senping, Senping, I have this.

asr-001135
01:06:25.560 --> 01:06:31.260
Senator Panfilo Lacson: For the record, ma'am.

asr-001136
01:06:31.780 --> 01:06:33.540
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sige, mas maganda, magaling po sa inyo.

asr-001137
01:06:35.120 --> 01:06:37.440
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sige, kunin nyo lang, pagpapawisang kayo.

asr-001138
01:06:37.440 --> 01:06:51.480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro, just ano, with the indulgence of Sen. Turtulpo, itong ano na talagang year-in, year-out talagang problema, itong procurement, yung mga expiring medicines, sayang din, ilang dang milyon.

asr-001139
01:06:51.940 --> 01:06:55.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro, if we can deduce away a system, na sinasabing yung Sen. Turtulpo.

asr-001140
01:06:56.120 --> 01:07:06.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Meron po kasi, alam sa amin, may mga local LGUs that now have, meron silang entity.

asr-001141
01:07:07.440 --> 01:07:11.180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Na prescription-based. Pero mahirap kasi sa DOH yun.

asr-001142
01:07:11.260 --> 01:07:17.240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi meron tayong, ano, yung mga health centers.

asr-001143
01:07:17.420 --> 01:07:23.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero sa kanila, hindi sila bumibili na ng maramihan, ng volume.

asr-001144
01:07:23.960 --> 01:07:27.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Because kung ano lang yung na-prescribe, that's the only medicines they pay.

asr-001145
01:07:28.060 --> 01:07:32.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So probably that's one option dun po sa mga local and provincial.

asr-001146
01:07:32.440 --> 01:07:35.620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But I don't know with DOH kung paano po pwedeng gawing sistema.

asr-001147
01:07:35.620 --> 01:07:37.360
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Tata mo.

asr-001148
01:07:37.440 --> 01:07:42.600
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So, Sen. JB, Mr. Chair, hindi ko makalimutan yun.

asr-001149
01:07:42.700 --> 01:07:46.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: I went to an island somewhere in Bohol a few years ago.

asr-001150
01:07:47.400 --> 01:07:50.340
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And nilapitan ako ng barangay chairwoman nila.

asr-001151
01:07:50.940 --> 01:07:53.380
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At sinasabi niya, wala rin nakakarating na gamot sa kanila.

asr-001152
01:07:54.540 --> 01:07:55.560
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Napakinggan yung hearing.

asr-001153
01:07:56.080 --> 01:08:02.260
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sir, nagulat kami nung mapakinggan namin na daan-daan milyon ang nage-expire na gamot.

asr-001154
01:08:02.360 --> 01:08:04.200
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Samantalang sa amin, wala po nakakarating.

asr-001155
01:08:04.200 --> 01:08:06.680
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Paano kayo nag-procure ng gamot?

asr-001156
01:08:07.440 --> 01:08:08.940
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Contribute po kami. Kami-kami.

asr-001157
01:08:09.140 --> 01:08:09.900
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Nag-aambag-ambag.

asr-001158
01:08:10.020 --> 01:08:11.740
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi walang dumarating sa health center namin.

asr-001159
01:08:11.900 --> 01:08:14.660
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kung meron man, kunti-kunti.

asr-001160
01:08:14.820 --> 01:08:15.760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And about to expire.

asr-001161
01:08:16.160 --> 01:08:17.180
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Di po ba nakakaya yun?

asr-001162
01:08:17.240 --> 01:08:20.120
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Not only that yung Prambola, kundi sa iba-iba pang mga health centers,

asr-001163
01:08:20.220 --> 01:08:23.860
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: barangay health centers nationwide, na kulang sa gamot.

asr-001164
01:08:25.060 --> 01:08:27.560
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kulang sa, especially sa mga maintenance na gamot.

asr-001165
01:08:28.560 --> 01:08:31.040
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Maski na mga simple lang na mga paracetamol.

asr-001166
01:08:31.500 --> 01:08:31.860
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Wala.

asr-001167
01:08:33.360 --> 01:08:33.900
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Di ba?

asr-001168
01:08:34.160 --> 01:08:35.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And yet,

asr-001169
01:08:36.320 --> 01:08:37.420
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: every single year,

asr-001170
01:08:37.440 --> 01:08:38.540
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: by the hundreds of millions,

asr-001171
01:08:38.620 --> 01:08:39.660
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: meron pa nga billions eh.

asr-001172
01:08:40.580 --> 01:08:41.100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Billion.

asr-001173
01:08:42.380 --> 01:08:43.220
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: 11, oh see?

asr-001174
01:08:43.620 --> 01:08:45.620
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: 11 billion pesos

asr-001175
01:08:45.620 --> 01:08:46.880
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ibinaon sa lupa.

asr-001176
01:08:48.240 --> 01:08:48.840
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: 2023,

asr-001177
01:08:49.080 --> 01:08:50.600
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: pang magkita ng expired na gamot.

asr-001178
01:08:50.940 --> 01:08:51.940
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Dapat dyan may makulong.

asr-001179
01:08:52.040 --> 01:08:53.480
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Dapat dyan may mapugutan ng ulo eh.

asr-001180
01:08:55.160 --> 01:08:57.280
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Napaka-skandaloso yung amount na yan.

asr-001181
01:08:57.740 --> 01:08:58.120
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yes po.

asr-001182
01:08:58.880 --> 01:09:00.540
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Mr. Chair, if I may po.

asr-001183
01:09:01.380 --> 01:09:02.100
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang mga,

asr-001184
01:09:02.860 --> 01:09:05.060
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: before I go to the expired meds nga po,

asr-001185
01:09:05.120 --> 01:09:06.020
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: may datos na kami.

asr-001186
01:09:06.020 --> 01:09:07.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero ang una po namin,

asr-001187
01:09:07.440 --> 01:09:08.440
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: yung pinag-aaralan,

asr-001188
01:09:08.440 --> 01:09:11.240
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ay parang yung nabanggit ni Sen. JV.

asr-001189
01:09:11.620 --> 01:09:12.880
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Talagang palakasin yung gamot

asr-001190
01:09:12.880 --> 01:09:14.460
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: para doon napadaanin.

asr-001191
01:09:14.460 --> 01:09:17.220
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At yung nakalaang budget

asr-001192
01:09:17.220 --> 01:09:19.320
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: para dito sa commodities,

asr-001193
01:09:19.320 --> 01:09:20.720
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: maibigay na lang sa PhilHealth

asr-001194
01:09:20.720 --> 01:09:22.520
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: para sila yung nagpa-purchase.

asr-001195
01:09:22.520 --> 01:09:23.220
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi at least,

asr-001196
01:09:23.580 --> 01:09:24.460
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: broad dyan.

asr-001197
01:09:24.460 --> 01:09:28.360
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At saka ang mga pharmacist na engaged namin ay nandun.

asr-001198
01:09:28.360 --> 01:09:30.060
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At negotiated naman po yung price.

asr-001199
01:09:30.060 --> 01:09:30.820
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, isa po yun.

asr-001200
01:09:31.320 --> 01:09:31.900
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pangalwa po,

asr-001201
01:09:31.900 --> 01:09:33.600
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: yung aming procurement nga yan,

asr-001202
01:09:33.600 --> 01:09:35.000
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: na decentralized na po,

asr-001203
01:09:35.500 --> 01:09:37.280
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: 40% na lang po yung pinoprocure sa iyo.

asr-001204
01:09:37.280 --> 01:09:37.920
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Or centrally,

asr-001205
01:09:37.920 --> 01:09:38.780
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: yung 60%,

asr-001206
01:09:38.780 --> 01:09:41.320
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: lalo na po yung mga common essential meds

asr-001207
01:09:41.320 --> 01:09:43.220
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: na meron naman locally available,

asr-001208
01:09:43.220 --> 01:09:45.920
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ay doon na po sa CHD ginagamit

asr-001209
01:09:45.920 --> 01:09:47.420
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: or pinoprocure.

asr-001210
