asr-002395
01:46:48.920 --> 01:46:54.280
NNC Executive Director IV and DOH Undersecretary Dr. Albert Francis E. Domingo: But the idea is, kailangan siyang i-link sa isang incentive na makukuha nung pamilya.

asr-002396
01:46:54.280 --> 01:46:59.160
NNC Executive Director IV and DOH Undersecretary Dr. Albert Francis E. Domingo: Maybe, baka mga food stamps program or yung walang gutom program.

asr-002397
