asr-002398
01:47:07.660 --> 01:47:16.640
NNC Executive Director IV and DOH Undersecretary Dr. Albert Francis E. Domingo: Or, another alternative, Mr. Chair, is we have around 42,000 to 45,000 barangay nutrition scholars na nandiyan po, dedicated.

