asr-002446
01:50:29.370 --> 01:50:33.810
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But there's also another implementation problem pagdating sa HVAP.

asr-002447
01:50:33.890 --> 01:50:39.750
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, what is the new team doing in order to address this implementation problem?

asr-002448
01:50:40.950 --> 01:50:45.430
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, ang direction nga po is look at the healthcare provider network ecosystem.

asr-002449
01:50:46.230 --> 01:50:55.270
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Whether it's geographically defined as a region or a particular province, depending on the actual situation on the ground.

asr-002450
01:50:55.270 --> 01:50:58.190
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, ang plano ko po ay mag-define.

asr-002451
01:50:58.190 --> 01:51:02.170
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ano ba dapat ang basic standard of a typical RHU?

asr-002452
01:51:02.810 --> 01:51:04.230
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: And then, ano po yung next level?

asr-002453
01:51:04.450 --> 01:51:07.450
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kailangan ba in every district may isang super health center?

asr-002454
01:51:08.230 --> 01:51:14.230
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: And then, going up in the province, should the district hospitals be standardized?

asr-002455
01:51:14.570 --> 01:51:22.570
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Para may standard din po for district hospitals of such a big geographic catchment, which should contain this equipment.

asr-002456
01:51:23.530 --> 01:51:25.730
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Allocative efficiency, Sen.

asr-002457
01:51:25.730 --> 01:51:27.030
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Para po alam natin.

asr-002458
01:51:27.230 --> 01:51:28.110
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi ngayon nga po.

asr-002459
01:51:28.190 --> 01:51:37.110
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: When I looked at the HVAP, tabi-tabi, gusto, kanya-kanyang MRI, kanya-kanyang CT scan, na hindi naman po ganong ka-efficient.

asr-002460
01:51:37.410 --> 01:51:40.570
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Meron pong tinatawag in the U.S. Certificate of Needs eh.

asr-002461
01:51:40.970 --> 01:51:50.870
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Bago ka maglagay ng bagong gamit, meron pong science into it to look sapat ba yung existing market mo to serve a particular facility.

asr-002462
01:51:51.030 --> 01:51:57.870
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, i-de-define po namin yan all the way up to the Apex Hospital, which could either be a tertiary provincial hospital,

asr-002463
01:51:58.190 --> 01:52:00.270
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: or a regional hospital.

asr-002464
01:52:00.710 --> 01:52:10.030
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, yun po muna moving forward yung gagawin namin para when the requests come in, mamamap out namin according to that tiering of the facilities.

asr-002465
01:52:10.710 --> 01:52:18.690
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: In the existing facilities po, tinitingnan ko nga, sabi ko ang priority nating tapusin ay yung mga completed but not operational,

asr-002466
01:52:18.950 --> 01:52:26.190
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: baka kulang lang ng gamit, or those that are partially completed but operating, baka kulang lang na matapos yung facility,

asr-002467
01:52:26.190 --> 01:52:27.190
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: or yung...

asr-002468
01:52:28.190 --> 01:52:32.450
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: partially completed but not operating, kulang ba naman power.

asr-002469
01:52:32.550 --> 01:52:33.490
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, we have to analyze.

asr-002470
01:52:34.390 --> 01:52:43.310
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: But again, moving forward po, apart from yung ating strategy ng allocative efficiency going up through the tiering of the value chain,

asr-002471
01:52:43.750 --> 01:52:50.750
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: is also look at compliant ba muna doon sa mga site conditions yung mga nagre-request.

asr-002472
01:52:50.750 --> 01:52:57.750
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, we already have the omnibus guidelines for the HVEP that the proponent needs to...

asr-002473
01:52:57.750 --> 01:52:58.870
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: needs to satisfy.

asr-002474
01:52:59.510 --> 01:53:01.850
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Otherwise po, hindi namin sinasama as priority.

asr-002475
01:53:02.050 --> 01:53:03.910
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Hindi pa na-transfer yung title ng lupa.

asr-002476
01:53:04.430 --> 01:53:08.750
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Wala ka namang ability to put up your...

asr-002477
01:53:09.290 --> 01:53:10.870
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Alimbawa po, may lumapit sa amin.

asr-002478
01:53:11.030 --> 01:53:11.750
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Bakit di kami na...

asr-002479
01:53:12.450 --> 01:53:13.050
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: na...

asr-002480
01:53:13.050 --> 01:53:13.110
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: na...

asr-002481
01:53:13.110 --> 01:53:14.290
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: kaklassify as...

asr-002482
01:53:14.290 --> 01:53:16.210
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: hindi nyo pa nabibigay yung CT scan sa amin.

asr-002483
01:53:16.590 --> 01:53:21.570
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: E wala pong three-phase transformer na at saka three-phase electricity available in the area.

asr-002484
01:53:22.110 --> 01:53:23.350
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, yun po yung aming iano.

asr-002485
01:53:23.490 --> 01:53:26.870
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Plus yung manpower availability rin po doon sa area.

asr-002486
01:53:26.870 --> 01:53:27.670
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Either we...

asr-002487
01:53:27.670 --> 01:53:32.910
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Augment or the LGU should be very clear in their MOA with us

asr-002488
01:53:32.910 --> 01:53:34.550
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: that they will provide the manpower.

asr-002489
01:53:34.730 --> 01:53:38.330
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi yun din po, pag na-finish, minsan sabi ng MOA, wala kaming pera.

asr-002490
01:53:38.670 --> 01:53:45.230
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kung kayo po ay compelled, because nasa MOA naman na dapat sa inyo po kayo mag-provide,

asr-002491
01:53:45.710 --> 01:53:47.370
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: dapat po, handa na rin yun.

asr-002492
01:53:47.510 --> 01:53:50.250
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, yun po yung tinatahi-tahi po namin.

asr-002493
01:53:52.770 --> 01:53:55.030
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Secretary, two things.

asr-002494
01:53:55.030 --> 01:53:57.190
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Number one, yung mga existing projects.

