asr-002498
01:54:04.930 --> 01:54:10.290
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Because nagbuos na tayo ng 17 billion dito sa mga facilities na ito.

asr-002499
01:54:10.370 --> 01:54:18.930
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, my first question is, how are you addressing or how will you address itong mga delays, unimplemented?

asr-002500
01:54:19.830 --> 01:54:21.770
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: How are you going to address that?

asr-002501
01:54:21.770 --> 01:54:26.850
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And then number two question is, may iba bang modality na much more efficient that we can use?

asr-002502
01:54:26.950 --> 01:54:27.550
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: For example,

asr-002503
01:54:27.670 --> 01:54:39.670
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: PPP, for example, private sector hospitals, then we give them incentives to take in public sector patients.

asr-002504
01:54:41.610 --> 01:54:44.470
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That's where PhilHealth, universal healthcare will come in.

asr-002505
01:54:44.830 --> 01:54:48.610
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, talagang sakit ng gobyerno pag nagpatayo, delay.

asr-002506
01:54:50.190 --> 01:54:56.870
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That's really a problem, not only in DOH, across the board yan.

asr-002507
01:54:57.670 --> 01:55:01.510
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Of the government agency.

asr-002508
01:55:01.690 --> 01:55:04.050
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, first question is, how do we address this?

asr-002509
01:55:04.150 --> 01:55:12.870
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Second is, are there other modalities that we can look at in order to solve this construction issue?

asr-002510
01:55:14.010 --> 01:55:14.770
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, yun nga po.

asr-002511
01:55:14.910 --> 01:55:15.790
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Sir Chairman, excuse me.

asr-002512
01:55:15.970 --> 01:55:16.710
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, send me.

asr-002513
01:55:16.810 --> 01:55:18.910
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Tutulungan ko lang sa magot si Secretary Mercado.

asr-002514
01:55:19.030 --> 01:55:21.130
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Alam ko nahihiyas siyang sabihin yung totoo.

asr-002515
01:55:23.530 --> 01:55:27.130
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ang major cost ng delay, ano, at saka yung mga underutilized.

asr-002516
01:55:27.670 --> 01:55:28.970
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Utilization ng pondo.

asr-002517
01:55:29.570 --> 01:55:30.410
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Insertions, diba?

asr-002518
01:55:31.490 --> 01:55:35.290
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, hindi kasalanan ng DOH kasi ito yung post-NEP.

asr-002519
01:55:36.570 --> 01:55:42.810
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Meron kayong programa sa NEP, hindi naman yung ma-implement properly kasi hindi kasama sa plano ninyo.

asr-002520
01:55:43.610 --> 01:55:47.150
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Because of insertions made by legislators.

asr-002521
01:55:48.770 --> 01:55:49.450
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Huwag nang kayong mahiya.

asr-002522
01:55:49.570 --> 01:55:50.470
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yan naman totoo, diba?

asr-002523
01:55:52.510 --> 01:55:53.110
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Partly.

asr-002524
01:55:54.010 --> 01:55:56.730
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaya po, kahit may mga request pong gano'n.

asr-002525
01:55:56.750 --> 01:55:57.150
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yan, yan.

asr-002526
01:55:57.150 --> 01:55:57.650
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yan lang po namin.

asr-002527
01:55:57.670 --> 01:56:02.250
Senator Panfilo Lacson: I know you're just being shy, you know, or you're just being polite.

asr-002528
01:56:02.330 --> 01:56:02.890
Senator Panfilo Lacson: But don't worry.

asr-002529
01:56:03.650 --> 01:56:12.490
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi pagdating sa BICAM, trabaho niya ni Senator JV na ma-arrest o kaya ma-address yung issue

asr-002530
01:56:12.490 --> 01:56:17.130
Senator Panfilo Lacson: na kaya nagkakaroon ng underutilization, mga hindi na-implement.

asr-002531
01:56:17.590 --> 01:56:19.230
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ganyan sa DPWH eh.

asr-002532
01:56:20.190 --> 01:56:23.290
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi paano i-implement kung hindi naman kayo nagplano?

asr-002533
01:56:23.870 --> 01:56:25.610
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kung saan-saan in-insert.

asr-002534
01:56:25.610 --> 01:56:27.210
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ito yung sa amendments.

asr-002535
01:56:27.670 --> 01:56:28.910
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Period of amendments.

asr-002536
01:56:29.150 --> 01:56:30.010
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kanya-kanya singitan.

asr-002537
01:56:31.470 --> 01:56:34.130
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Tapos hindi naman ma-implement kasi wala sa plano ninyo.

asr-002538
01:56:35.110 --> 01:56:36.490
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Wala sa priorities ninyo.

asr-002539
01:56:37.130 --> 01:56:38.190
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Wala sa needs ninyo.

asr-002540
01:56:39.950 --> 01:56:44.350
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yun namang legislator na nagsingit, wala rin naman siyang coordination sa DOH.

asr-002541
01:56:46.050 --> 01:56:47.850
Senator Panfilo Lacson: It's bad enough na nag-insert.

asr-002542
01:56:48.030 --> 01:56:51.170
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pero at least man lang, prior to insertion or amendment,

asr-002543
01:56:51.610 --> 01:56:54.910
Senator Panfilo Lacson: nagsabi, bumusin naman lang na ito ba kaya nating implement.

asr-002544
01:56:55.790 --> 01:56:57.650
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, huwag na ka mahiya, Sekretary.

asr-002545
01:56:57.670 --> 01:57:04.590
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Sen Ping, yung nabanggit ni Secretary na HFEP guidelines, malaking bagay yun.

asr-002546
01:57:05.370 --> 01:57:09.610
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I agree with Sen Ping na lalo na, siguro may second round.

asr-002547
01:57:10.150 --> 01:57:12.670
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Nakita ko yung isa rin sa mga problema, yung super health centers.

asr-002548
01:57:14.170 --> 01:57:19.250
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Na ang daming unused, i-flash ko na nga since andito na tayo.

asr-002549
01:57:19.950 --> 01:57:23.670
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yung slide 20.

asr-002550
01:57:26.160 --> 01:57:27.440
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Slide 20, Elena.

asr-002551
01:57:27.440 --> 01:57:27.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yan.

asr-002552
01:57:31.830 --> 01:57:32.070
