asr-002555
01:57:40.290 --> 01:57:45.790
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: About 3.9 billion completed, not completed or no clear status update.

asr-002556
01:57:45.970 --> 01:57:49.410
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Meaning, hindi alam kung anong situation na.

asr-002557
01:57:50.070 --> 01:57:55.070
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, ito rin isang mga nakita namin problema.

asr-002558
01:57:56.450 --> 01:58:00.610
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ito, connectado sa sinabi ni Sen Ping, na marami rin kasing mga

asr-002559
01:58:00.610 --> 01:58:06.970
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: na i-insert ng super health center, ayaw naman ng LGU patakbuhin dahil ayaw nilang magbayad ng kuryente.

asr-002560
01:58:07.570 --> 01:58:09.150
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Hindi sila makakuha ng nurse.

asr-002561
01:58:09.690 --> 01:58:11.110
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ayaw nilang bumili ng gamot.

asr-002562
01:58:11.870 --> 01:58:17.550
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, in other words, nakatayo na yung super health center, ayaw ang kininong LGU.

asr-002563
01:58:17.750 --> 01:58:19.830
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, nagiging problema rin.

asr-002564
01:58:21.830 --> 01:58:29.550
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I think this is something that hopefully your guidelines, kung strictly ma-implementa, can be resolved.

asr-002565
