Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi nagugulantang na lang kami na mayroon palang biglang are issues na hindi naman nakasama doon sa local health investment plan ng pabilisya.

asr-002568
01:58:50.570 --> 01:58:53.650
Senator Panfilo Lacson: These are institutional problems that must be addressed.

asr-002569
01:58:54.690 --> 01:58:58.310
Senator Panfilo Lacson: This is beyond your level already.

asr-002570
01:58:59.450 --> 01:59:00.490
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi pagdating ng budget,

asr-002571
01:59:00.610 --> 01:59:01.930
Senator Panfilo Lacson: the deliberations,

asr-002572
01:59:02.450 --> 01:59:04.070
Senator Panfilo Lacson: medyo, anyway.

