01:59:08.430 --> 01:59:10.350
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: kung may mga ganyong pagkakataon,

asr-002576
01:59:10.510 --> 01:59:12.250
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: dapat naman mag-align dahil nga po

asr-002577
01:59:12.250 --> 01:59:14.590
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: nasasayang. Then secondly nga po,

asr-002578
01:59:14.710 --> 01:59:16.410
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: even the way we download and

asr-002579
01:59:16.410 --> 01:59:18.550
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: we procure. So, ako gawin na natin

asr-002580
01:59:18.550 --> 01:59:20.410
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: just like what you said earlier po,

asr-002581
01:59:20.930 --> 01:59:22.890
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Senwin, na yung local government,

asr-002582
01:59:23.050 --> 01:59:24.570
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: kasi kung sila, may responsibility

asr-002583
01:59:24.570 --> 01:59:26.530
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: rin sila at meron silang accountability

asr-002584
01:59:26.530 --> 01:59:28.010
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: kung di nila ma-operate.

asr-002585
01:59:28.310 --> 01:59:30.450
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi sila may

asr-002586
