Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: PPP, pinag-usapan na po namin

asr-002589
01:59:36.450 --> 01:59:38.350
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: yan sa PISAC. Ako rin po ay nakaupo doon

asr-002590
01:59:38.350 --> 01:59:40.050
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: sa Private Sector Advisory Council.

asr-002591
01:59:40.550 --> 01:59:42.770
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang hiling daw po ng private sector,

asr-002592
01:59:43.370 --> 01:59:44.890
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: eh, syempre, mamumuhunang kami.

asr-002593
01:59:45.450 --> 01:59:46.390
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Huwag naman akalain

asr-002594
01:59:46.390 --> 01:59:47.470
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ng mga tao na

asr-002595
