Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: paano kami magiging

asr-002596
01:59:49.690 --> 01:59:51.570
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: at least break-even.

asr-002597
01:59:51.830 --> 01:59:54.510
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: There's a financial model that should be

asr-002598
01:59:54.510 --> 01:59:55.410
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: well thought of.

asr-002599
01:59:56.170 --> 01:59:58.330
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaya sabi namin, meron naman pong

asr-002600
01:59:58.330 --> 02:00:00.460
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: yakap na na nagbabayad.

asr-002601
