Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Although kasi po yung yakap sa private sector nakakasingil po ng additional copay up to 900 pesos. So kung siya po ay considered na LGU na pinipipi, magpo-fall ba siya under the private sector classification or LGU?

asr-002602
02:00:15.660 --> 02:00:39.780
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yun po yung pinag-uusapan pa namin po. Although paglapad naman po at pagkakinong coverage ng yakap at yung pong incentives na binibigay namin, yan nga po gaya ng top up para yung first 1,000 day gawin yung mabuti, babayaran namin kada referred o kada bakunang ibigay, maka magkakaroon pa rin po ng additional revenue ang ating pong mga yakap clinics. So yun po yung pinag-uusapan namin.

asr-002603
02:00:39.780 --> 02:00:43.140
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you, Secretary. And lastly, Mr. Chairman.

asr-002604
02:00:43.500 --> 02:00:43.920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Mr. Chair.

asr-002605
02:00:44.120 --> 02:00:45.620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: That's why yung 2020.

asr-002606
02:00:45.660 --> 02:01:07.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: In 2026, when I was chairing the Finance Committee, hindi na po namin sinama yung mga bagong super health centers. Ang pinondohan lang po namin yung to complete the super health centers. Kasi nga during the budget hearing, narinig po namin na maraming LGUs tinatanggihan yung super health centers.

asr-002607
02:01:07.560 --> 02:01:16.860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So kuryente, hindi rin nila mabayaran. Tubig, hindi nila mabayaran. Walang nurse doon, walang doktor. So nagtataka naman sila na tayo na yung super health centers.

asr-002608
02:01:17.000 --> 02:01:17.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So patayin.

asr-002609
02:01:17.680 --> 02:01:23.740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pa-rectify na lang yun kasi nandoon na ho yung super health centers. At the same time, Secretary.

asr-002610
02:01:24.400 --> 02:01:26.120
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mr. Chair, Senate President, if I may lang.

asr-002611
02:01:26.480 --> 02:01:27.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Taposin ko na lang.

asr-002612
02:01:27.300 --> 02:01:29.300
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Taposin ko na lang.

asr-002613
02:01:29.300 --> 02:01:43.020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And then, Secretary, let's explore other modalities. Kasi mga other modalities can be much more efficient. Especially meron na tayong universal health care.

asr-002614
02:01:43.180 --> 02:01:46.660
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang gusto lang naman ng mga private sector, pag nagtayo kami, mababayaran kami.

asr-002615
02:01:47.680 --> 02:02:00.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Universal health care can step into that. So let's explore. Kasi kung gobyerno parating magpapatayo, it's either uncompleted, hindi compliant, medyo nasasayang yung pera.

asr-002616
02:02:00.740 --> 02:02:01.780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-002617
02:02:02.480 --> 02:02:03.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, our Senate President.

asr-002618
02:02:04.640 --> 02:02:09.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, we plan to take a lunch break. Parang kasi ang pangit naman nagla-lunch tayo.

asr-002619
02:02:10.720 --> 02:02:17.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro mga 30-minute lunch break. But before that, our Senator Bongo would like to give his opening statement, I believe.

asr-002620
02:02:17.680 --> 02:02:23.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat po, Mr. Chair, Senate President, Senator Lackson, Mr. Chair, Senator JV.

asr-002621
02:02:23.880 --> 02:02:32.080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pakibalik lang po yung slides kanina. Kaya gusto ko sanang pumasok sa sumingit kay Senate President.

asr-002622
02:02:33.980 --> 02:02:34.460
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yan, yan.

asr-002623
02:02:36.200 --> 02:02:45.460
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Secretary Mercado, last year po, binigyan ng prioridad ni Senator Win Gatchalian, then Finance Chair.

asr-002624
02:02:45.460 --> 02:02:46.800
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Now, Senator.

asr-002625
02:02:47.680 --> 02:02:52.580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Senate President Win Gatchalian, na mabigyan ng prioridad yung completion.

asr-002626
02:02:53.420 --> 02:03:01.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yun po yung naging usapan noon to make it operational at magamit po itong mga super health center.

asr-002627
02:03:02.140 --> 02:03:11.540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At marami, I agree with the Senate President na yung iba, mayroon pong mga LGUs na hirap pong patakbuhin ito.

asr-002628
02:03:11.540 --> 02:03:17.540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: But marami pong mga LGUs na gusto at willing, lalong-lalo na po yung mga liblib

asr-002629
02:03:17.680 --> 02:03:19.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: na lugar, yung mga islands.

asr-002630
02:03:19.300 --> 02:03:26.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Remember, more than 7,000 islands po tayo sa buong Pilipinas, lalo na sa Mindanao.

asr-002631
02:03:27.340 --> 02:03:36.580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Meron pong mga lugar doon, 4 hours ang biyahe sa bangka, papunta lang sa town proper, another 2 hours papunta sa hospital.

asr-002632
02:03:36.760 --> 02:03:40.220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Halimbawa na lang po yung Balot Island sa Mindanao.

asr-002633
02:03:40.360 --> 02:03:43.340
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: 4 hours yun, yun yung na-earthquake recently.

asr-002634
02:03:43.980 --> 02:03:47.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung mga buntis doon, nanganak na lang sa bangka sa sobrang layo.

asr-002635
02:03:47.680 --> 02:03:49.460
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ngayon, meron na silang super health center.

asr-002636
02:03:49.540 --> 02:03:53.920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Marami pong mga lugar na willing rin po silang malagyan ng super health center.

asr-002637
02:03:54.020 --> 02:03:55.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Tulad ng Tingloy, Batangas.

asr-002638
02:03:56.280 --> 02:04:01.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: 1 hour ang biyahe papunta sa Batangas, another 1 hour papunta po sa Batangas Medical Center.

asr-002639
02:04:01.680 --> 02:04:05.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Willing yung LGUs, complement each other.

asr-002640
02:04:05.240 --> 02:04:10.120
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ang importante po dyan, magko-complement po ang LGUs at saka yung DOH.

asr-002641
02:04:10.560 --> 02:04:11.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mag-aralan yung mabuti.

asr-002642
02:04:12.460 --> 02:04:17.480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kung kaya ba nila, bago nyo pasukin, bago nyo pirmahan yung kontrata.

asr-002643
02:04:17.680 --> 02:04:19.300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kung kaya ba nilang mag-operate.

asr-002644
02:04:19.640 --> 02:04:23.440
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Marami pong mga LGUs na willingly na mag-operate po.

asr-002645
02:04:23.920 --> 02:04:24.860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: May kakayahan.

asr-002646
02:04:25.080 --> 02:04:27.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung iba naman po talaga totoo, hindi rin po nilang kaya.

asr-002647
02:04:28.460 --> 02:04:32.800
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So, importante po dyan, yung DOH, kayo po ang may regional offices.

asr-002648
02:04:33.200 --> 02:04:36.200
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kayo po yung pwedeng magpa-check kung meron ba silang kakayahan.

asr-002649
02:04:37.000 --> 02:04:39.940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Complement each other lang po ang DOH at yung LGUs.

asr-002650
02:04:40.320 --> 02:04:42.840
