Senator Joel Villanueva: In a previous, I forgot where I heard about PhilHealth's target or desire

asr-005076
04:33:00.250 --> 04:33:05.170
Senator Joel Villanueva: to raise the 14-15% doubling it.

asr-005077
04:33:05.290 --> 04:33:07.650
Senator Joel Villanueva: I don't know if I heard it from you, ma'am, actually,

asr-005078
04:33:07.750 --> 04:33:13.790
Senator Joel Villanueva: but I encountered this article na that's part of the goal,

asr-005079
04:33:13.790 --> 04:33:19.790
Senator Joel Villanueva: yung doblehin from 14-15 maging 25 to actually,

asr-005080
04:33:19.890 --> 04:33:21.630
Senator Joel Villanueva: actually, to 30%.

asr-005081
04:33:21.630 --> 04:33:31.390
Senator Joel Villanueva: And that's part noong pagpapalawak po noong funding natin sa universal healthcare law.

asr-005082
04:33:31.810 --> 04:33:35.030
Senator Joel Villanueva: Is that correct? Is that an accurate statement, ma'am?

asr-005083
04:33:35.730 --> 04:33:36.550
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Yes, Chair.

asr-005084
04:33:36.690 --> 04:33:43.930
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Yung increasing the PhilHealth share to as much as 30% of the total health expenditure.

asr-005085
04:33:43.930 --> 04:33:46.250
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Ngayon po kasi nasa 19% siya.

asr-005086
04:33:48.900 --> 04:33:50.000
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, okay.

asr-005087
04:33:51.260 --> 04:33:53.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: That's a welcome development.

asr-005088
04:33:54.280 --> 04:33:57.300
Senator Joel Villanueva: But puntahan po natin yung sinasabi nyo,

asr-005089
04:33:57.360 --> 04:34:06.100
Senator Joel Villanueva: 60,000 beds sa yung tinatarget ng zero-balance billing.

asr-005090
04:34:06.360 --> 04:34:08.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: In fact, when we heard about this,

asr-005091
04:34:08.140 --> 04:34:10.320
Senator Joel Villanueva: a lot of our colleagues here in the Senate were talking,

asr-005092
04:34:10.600 --> 04:34:13.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: saan ba talaga itong mga zero-balance billing?

asr-005093
04:34:13.240 --> 04:34:16.360
Senator Joel Villanueva: And every time I go around, may lalapit sa akin,

asr-005094
04:34:16.660 --> 04:34:20.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: walang makita saan ba itong nakalagay.

asr-005095
04:34:20.640 --> 04:34:22.860
Senator Joel Villanueva: Tapos, meron naman.

asr-005096
04:34:23.140 --> 04:34:27.980
Senator Joel Villanueva: But, you know, in fairness, I encountered someone here in Metro Manila,

asr-005097
04:34:28.720 --> 04:34:31.780
Senator Joel Villanueva: Metro Manila Hospital, na zero-balance po siya.

asr-005098
04:34:31.920 --> 04:34:36.180
Senator Joel Villanueva: It's just that parang the entire time na I was going around,

asr-005099
04:34:36.360 --> 04:34:39.040
Senator Joel Villanueva: ang narinig ko po ay dito lang sa Metro Manila.

asr-005100
04:34:39.580 --> 04:34:43.860
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, itong 60,000 beds, is it scattered around?

asr-005101
04:34:44.240 --> 04:34:45.020
Senator Joel Villanueva: At ilan po ito?

asr-005102
04:34:45.220 --> 04:34:48.760
Senator Joel Villanueva: And perhaps the most important part of the question is,

asr-005103
04:34:48.760 --> 04:34:50.620
Senator Joel Villanueva: ilan na po ba yung nag-benefit?

asr-005104
04:34:50.640 --> 04:34:57.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasi, kung ilan lamang po, kasi ilan bang pasyente sa Pilipinas?

asr-005105
04:34:58.140 --> 04:35:04.580
Senator Joel Villanueva: Tapos, kasabihin natin na ilang porsyento ng pasyente yung nakaka-avail lang

asr-005106
04:35:04.580 --> 04:35:06.040
Senator Joel Villanueva: o makaka-avail lang nito.

asr-005107
04:35:06.840 --> 04:35:12.520
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasi parang ang hirap naman din po na mapakinggan ito

asr-005108
04:35:12.520 --> 04:35:16.540
Senator Joel Villanueva: every time nire-report natin na we are improving.

asr-005109
04:35:16.960 --> 04:35:17.580
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you, ma'am.

asr-005110
04:35:17.980 --> 04:35:20.560
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Chair, maybe I'll start po with the breakdown.

asr-005111
04:35:20.640 --> 04:35:22.240
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: of the no-balance billing beds.

asr-005112
04:35:22.380 --> 04:35:24.820
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: And then, si Sec po can talk about the beneficiaries.

asr-005113
04:35:25.300 --> 04:35:29.240
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, sir, by law po, all of the public hospitals,

asr-005114
04:35:29.360 --> 04:35:34.560
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: except the GOCC hospitals, 90% of their beds are supposed to be for NBB.

asr-005115
04:35:35.080 --> 04:35:39.720
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: And then, 10% of private hospital beds are supposed to be NBB.

asr-005116
04:35:40.220 --> 04:35:44.640
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, parang with that breakdown po, at least for the government beds,

asr-005117
04:35:46.640 --> 04:35:52.000
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: a total of 59,790

asr-005118
04:35:52.000 --> 04:35:55.500
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: beds are supposed to be NBB beds in the government.

asr-005119
04:35:56.200 --> 04:36:02.520
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: And then, for private, that's supposed to be 6,265 beds.

asr-005120
04:36:02.900 --> 04:36:07.400
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, yung total po dapat, meron tayong in-existence na no-balance billing beds

asr-005121
04:36:07.400 --> 04:36:10.680
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: na 66,055 in the country.

asr-005122
04:36:11.280 --> 04:36:17.080
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, I guess, nag-umpisa po siya na nagtaas yung PhilHealth ng case rates

asr-005123
04:36:17.080 --> 04:36:18.960
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: to hopefully cover the whole bill.

asr-005124
04:36:18.960 --> 04:36:19.960
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: And then, supplemented by...

asr-005125
04:36:20.640 --> 04:36:24.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: Okay. Yung 6,000, yun lang yung sa private?

asr-005126
04:36:25.460 --> 04:36:27.140
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Yan po yung mandated nila.

asr-005127
04:36:27.740 --> 04:36:28.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: Because that's mandated.

asr-005128
04:36:29.000 --> 04:36:33.900
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Yes, shared accommodation.

asr-005129
04:36:34.160 --> 04:36:37.760
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: And siguro, sir, we also would like to be very honest din naman na

asr-005130
04:36:37.760 --> 04:36:41.480
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: to say na in theory, they are mandated to do it.

asr-005131
04:36:41.800 --> 04:36:46.240
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: But because for many years, hindi naman din, I guess, commensurate pa yung bayad.

asr-005132
04:36:46.300 --> 04:36:47.360
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, mahirap i-enforce.

asr-005133
04:36:47.360 --> 04:36:50.440
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: But now, a lot of the private hospitals,

asr-005134
04:36:50.640 --> 04:36:52.580
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: are actually already doing it.

asr-005135
04:36:52.660 --> 04:36:56.600
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: And we're really serious in partnering with them to make it happen.

asr-005136
04:36:56.880 --> 04:36:58.000
Senator Joel Villanueva: It's good news, no?

asr-005137
04:36:58.020 --> 04:36:59.920
Senator Joel Villanueva: There are 60,000 beds available.

asr-005138
04:37:00.480 --> 04:37:07.440
Senator Joel Villanueva: And these are patients na hindi po nangangailangan ng surgery.

asr-005139
04:37:08.420 --> 04:37:11.200
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasi parang, yun yung gusto kong maintindihan.

asr-005140
04:37:11.280 --> 04:37:14.840
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ano yung pinaka-basic, ano lang po niya, no?

asr-005141
04:37:14.840 --> 04:37:16.840
Senator Joel Villanueva: Again, 60,000 is...

asr-005142
04:37:18.160 --> 04:37:19.840
Senator Joel Villanueva: I mean, compared to our denominator, medyo...

asr-005143
04:37:20.640 --> 04:37:21.700
Senator Joel Villanueva: Malayo yan.

asr-005144
04:37:21.860 --> 04:37:25.560
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I'm sure we wanted to increase it by...

asr-005145
04:37:25.560 --> 04:37:27.380
Senator Joel Villanueva: I mean, increase the target by next year.

asr-005146
04:37:27.660 --> 04:37:29.180
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sir, sige po, sekretary.

asr-005147
04:37:30.020 --> 04:37:31.820
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Mr. Chair, to give context po,

asr-005148
04:37:31.940 --> 04:37:35.880
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ang total bed available po sa Pilipinas ay mga 120,000.

asr-005149
04:37:36.760 --> 04:37:41.640
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, yun po ay mix na ng DOH, LGU, at saka po ng mga private beds.

asr-005150
04:37:42.180 --> 04:37:46.880
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang DOH beds po, nakasama yung regional dito sa Manila,

asr-005151
04:37:46.880 --> 04:37:49.080
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: at saka yung four GOCC hospitals,

asr-005152
04:37:49.520 --> 04:37:50.560
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: are about 3,000.

asr-005153
04:37:50.640 --> 04:37:51.660
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: 32,400.

asr-005154
04:37:52.680 --> 04:37:55.920
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At ang LGU po ay mga 21,600.

asr-005155
04:37:56.360 --> 04:37:58.540
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, ang sumatotal po,

asr-005156
04:37:59.060 --> 04:38:02.760
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: kalahati ng bed capacity ng buong Pilipinas,

asr-005157
04:38:02.860 --> 04:38:04.640
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ang aming tinatarget na maging NBB.

asr-005158
04:38:05.200 --> 04:38:05.880
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, ano po yun?

asr-005159
04:38:05.980 --> 04:38:08.620
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Hindi naman po nangangahulugan na lahat po yan,

asr-005160
04:38:08.720 --> 04:38:12.280
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ang strategiya ay magdagdag ng bayad.

asr-005161
04:38:12.420 --> 04:38:13.720
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi inflationary po eh.

asr-005162
04:38:13.940 --> 04:38:16.040
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kahit kami nagdadagdag, nagtataas din.

asr-005163
04:38:16.040 --> 04:38:19.040
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yun po ay nature na talaga ng health economy.

asr-005164
04:38:20.640 --> 04:38:22.760
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, ano po dito, dapat yung strategic purchasing.

asr-005165
04:38:23.100 --> 04:38:24.600
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, ano po yung strategic purchasing?

asr-005166
04:38:25.320 --> 04:38:28.220
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Dahil kami po yung pinakal-largest purchaser,

asr-005167
04:38:28.800 --> 04:38:32.940
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: pwede po kaming makipag-negotiate sa mga hospital.

asr-005168
04:38:33.700 --> 04:38:35.980
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaya nga po ngayon, nag-i-engage na po yung hospital,

asr-005169
04:38:36.160 --> 04:38:39.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ay dahil napababa na po natin yung turnaround time ng payment.

asr-005170
04:38:40.040 --> 04:38:43.680
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Dati po, ayaw pumayag dahil, eh, anim na buwan bago kayo magbayad eh.

asr-005171
04:38:44.280 --> 04:38:46.620
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaya maglalagay kami ng cost of money, di ho ba?

asr-005172
04:38:46.620 --> 04:38:50.340
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kahit nailagay ko yan sa banko, makumikita na ako ng interest.

asr-005173
04:38:50.340 --> 04:38:52.120
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaysa nakabin-bin.

asr-005174
04:38:52.280 --> 04:38:54.480
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, ngayon po na naka-15 days na kami,

asr-005175
04:38:55.040 --> 04:38:56.160
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: nag-i-enter na sila.

asr-005176
04:38:56.260 --> 04:38:58.860
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Sige, pahayag na kami ng NOBI-NBB ngayon.

asr-005177
04:38:58.980 --> 04:39:00.680
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Bukod dun sa tinaas natin yung coverage.

asr-005178
04:39:01.300 --> 04:39:03.420
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero isa pa po dun sa aming pinag-iisipan,

asr-005179
04:39:03.560 --> 04:39:04.840
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ay yung upfront payment.

asr-005180
04:39:04.980 --> 04:39:06.240
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yun nga po yung global budget.

asr-005181
04:39:06.800 --> 04:39:10.220
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi hawak na po nung ating mga hospital, yung pera.

asr-005182
04:39:10.780 --> 04:39:13.440
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, which means, pwede po nilang gamitin for purchase

asr-005183
04:39:13.440 --> 04:39:15.260
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ng mga equipment, ng mga supplies,

asr-005184
04:39:15.740 --> 04:39:18.200
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: para ma-hedge din po nila yung pagtaas ng presyo.

asr-005185
04:39:18.640 --> 04:39:19.840
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At bultuhan,

asr-005186
04:39:19.840 --> 04:39:21.940
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: mas maibababa, maninegosyate po nilang

asr-005187
04:39:21.940 --> 04:39:24.440
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ibaba yung presyo ng kanilang mga consumables.

asr-005188
04:39:24.940 --> 04:39:26.440
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, yun po yung mga statihiya.

asr-005189
04:39:26.640 --> 04:39:29.100
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaya po, ang aming tinitingnan,

asr-005190
04:39:29.660 --> 04:39:32.620
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ay yung pong parang kagaya po ng One Hospital Command

asr-005191
04:39:32.620 --> 04:39:33.740
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: nung kasagsagan ng COVID.

asr-005192
04:39:34.300 --> 04:39:35.360
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Titingnan po namin,

asr-005193
04:39:35.880 --> 04:39:39.880
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ano po yung sobra na nakapila sa mga government hospital.

asr-005194
04:39:40.260 --> 04:39:41.820
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At kakausapin namin yung private,

asr-005195
04:39:41.940 --> 04:39:43.200
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: o yung 10% bed nyo,

asr-005196
04:39:43.600 --> 04:39:45.600
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ipasok natin para ma-offload natin.

asr-005197
04:39:46.020 --> 04:39:48.300
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At bukod dun sa first-liner ng PhilHealth,

asr-005198
04:39:48.900 --> 04:39:49.740
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: papasok namin ngayon.

asr-005199
04:39:49.740 --> 04:39:50.360
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung MyPip.

asr-005200
04:39:50.640 --> 04:39:53.000
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi po, MyPip, dapat dun sa mga outliers eh.

asr-005201
04:39:53.560 --> 04:39:55.000
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi hindi naman po mako-cover

asr-005202
04:39:55.000 --> 04:39:56.520
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ng lahat ng case rates.

asr-005203
04:39:56.680 --> 04:39:58.920
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pag Z-Bend, dapat wala nang dagdag yan.

asr-005204
04:39:59.040 --> 04:40:00.540
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi substantial na yung Z-Bend,

asr-005205
04:40:00.780 --> 04:40:02.180
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: 1 million to 4 million eh.

asr-005206
04:40:02.560 --> 04:40:03.500
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero yung mga outliers,

asr-005207
04:40:04.000 --> 04:40:05.680
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: dapat po, appendectomy simple,

asr-005208
04:40:06.140 --> 04:40:08.140
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: dapat mga 30,000 in ICU.

asr-005209
04:40:08.740 --> 04:40:09.900
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi nagperitonitis,

asr-005210
04:40:10.120 --> 04:40:11.140
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: nagkaroon ng komplikasyon.

asr-005211
04:40:11.540 --> 04:40:13.260
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Dun po papasok dapat yung MyPip.

asr-005212
04:40:13.440 --> 04:40:14.700
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, dapat po rules-based,

asr-005213
04:40:15.120 --> 04:40:16.360
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: supplemental ang MyPips

asr-005214
04:40:16.360 --> 04:40:17.780
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: dun sa coverage po ng PhilHealth

asr-005215
04:40:17.780 --> 04:40:19.400
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: para ma-achieve po natin yung NBB.

asr-005216
04:40:19.740 --> 04:40:21.040
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Negotiated po yung rates

asr-005217
04:40:21.040 --> 04:40:22.100
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: dun po sa mga hospital.

asr-005218
04:40:23.000 --> 04:40:24.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you, Secretary.

asr-005219
04:40:25.260 --> 04:40:28.800
Senator Joel Villanueva: We appreciate the answer, Mr. Chairman.

asr-005220
04:40:29.260 --> 04:40:31.160
Senator Joel Villanueva: I'll go to my next topic

asr-005221
04:40:31.160 --> 04:40:32.300
Senator Joel Villanueva: unless, Mr. Chairman,

asr-005222
04:40:32.400 --> 04:40:33.780
Senator Joel Villanueva: you wanted to say something

asr-005223
04:40:33.780 --> 04:40:34.840
Senator Joel Villanueva: about the zero billing.

asr-005224
04:40:35.180 --> 04:40:36.700
Senator Joel Villanueva: As I'm going to the next topic,

asr-005225
04:40:37.180 --> 04:40:39.600
Senator Joel Villanueva: or Senator Pia would like to...

asr-005226
04:40:39.600 --> 04:40:41.400
Senator Joel Villanueva: I'm leaving the zero billing

asr-005227
04:40:41.400 --> 04:40:43.700
Senator Joel Villanueva: if you want to...

asr-005228
04:40:43.700 --> 04:40:46.680
Senator Joel Villanueva: I'll go to another topic.

asr-005229
04:40:47.900 --> 04:40:48.800
Senator Joel Villanueva: I'm sure...

asr-005230
04:40:48.800 --> 04:40:49.360
Senator Joel Villanueva: I'm sure...

asr-005231
04:40:49.360 --> 04:40:52.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: Because I was looking at you last time

asr-005232
04:40:52.420 --> 04:40:54.700
Senator Joel Villanueva: we were together and talking about this.

asr-005233
04:40:55.160 --> 04:40:55.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yes, okay.

asr-005234
04:40:55.680 --> 04:40:56.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: I'm sure you don't...

asr-005235
04:40:56.220 --> 04:40:58.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Very quickly, just to add to the zero billing issue.

asr-005236
04:40:59.940 --> 04:41:03.100
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, for the 2026 budget,

asr-005237
04:41:03.700 --> 04:41:06.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: when I chaired the budget of PhilHealth,

asr-005238
04:41:07.000 --> 04:41:08.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: we included 1 billion.

asr-005239
04:41:08.380 --> 04:41:08.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Alam niyo yun?

asr-005240
04:41:09.140 --> 04:41:11.540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: For pilot testing in the LGUs.

asr-005241
04:41:12.540 --> 04:41:14.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And I just learned that

asr-005242
04:41:14.720 --> 04:41:18.480
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: that amount is going to be made...

asr-005243
04:41:18.480 --> 04:41:20.840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: What happened as of August 25?

asr-005244
04:41:21.260 --> 04:41:26.520
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Na-download na yung funds on August 25 lang.

asr-005245
04:41:26.660 --> 04:41:27.760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, like two weeks ago.

asr-005246
04:41:28.460 --> 04:41:30.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, yung opportunity natin

asr-005247
04:41:30.320 --> 04:41:31.540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: to do the pilot testing

asr-005248
04:41:31.540 --> 04:41:33.840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: so that we could give a bigger amount this year.

asr-005249
04:41:34.280 --> 04:41:35.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It's kind of lost, no?

asr-005250
04:41:35.220 --> 04:41:36.760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But I will just assume that

