05:53:00.780 --> 05:53:02.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then when we do oversight,

asr-007615
05:53:02.440 --> 05:53:03.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: like in the budget,

asr-007616
05:53:03.420 --> 05:53:05.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: na paulit-ulit kaming parang sirang plaka.

asr-007617
05:53:06.840 --> 05:53:08.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So you have to fight for it

asr-007618
05:53:08.380 --> 05:53:11.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: because the Filipino people deserve this.

asr-007619
05:53:11.720 --> 05:53:13.340
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And it was allocated for health.

asr-007620
05:53:13.460 --> 05:53:16.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It was not allocated for economic recovery.

asr-007621
05:53:16.740 --> 05:53:19.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It was not allocated for some other important need.

asr-007622
05:53:19.780 --> 05:53:21.440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It was allocated for health.

asr-007623
05:53:21.820 --> 05:53:25.760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So this is not to diminish the importance of other concerns,

asr-007624
05:53:26.020 --> 05:53:27.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: but this was allocated for health.

asr-007625
05:53:29.360 --> 05:53:31.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So there you have it.

asr-007626
05:53:32.440 --> 05:53:38.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So I leave those imaginary funds in your imagination.

asr-007627
