asr-007629
05:53:51.670 --> 05:53:54.410
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But I'm putting on record, you are nodding your head vigorously,

asr-007630
05:53:54.410 --> 05:53:59.410
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: both the Secretary of Health and the President of PhilHealth.

asr-007631
