Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Ang kasama nyo.

asr-007637
05:54:04.890 --> 05:54:05.890
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Do you want the funds?

asr-007638
05:54:06.010 --> 05:54:06.770
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yes or no?

asr-007639
05:54:06.990 --> 05:54:07.290
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-007640
05:54:07.450 --> 05:54:07.950
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Thank you.

asr-007641
