Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Likewise.

asr-007642
05:54:09.170 --> 05:54:10.850
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you for bringing that up, Senator Pia.

asr-007643
05:54:10.850 --> 05:54:12.010
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I know that every year,

asr-007644
05:54:12.330 --> 05:54:14.830
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: you've been bringing this up with our DBCC.

asr-007645
05:54:15.730 --> 05:54:19.750
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And these funds really belong to PhilHealth

asr-007646
05:54:19.750 --> 05:54:21.550
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and for the UAC implementation

asr-007647
05:54:21.550 --> 05:54:24.330
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and not for any other purpose.

asr-007648
05:54:24.510 --> 05:54:25.790
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Talagang kanila yan eh.

asr-007649
05:54:25.850 --> 05:54:28.610
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So we will just have to keep on

asr-007650
05:54:28.610 --> 05:54:32.310
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: pushing them to the wall to release,

asr-007651
05:54:32.410 --> 05:54:33.050
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kahit partial.

asr-007652
05:54:33.050 --> 05:54:34.130
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Because hopefully,

asr-007653
05:54:34.150 --> 05:54:38.170
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: it can cover yung deficit na binagat kanin ni Doc Bev, no?

asr-007654
05:54:38.170 --> 05:54:39.890
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Na about minimum,

asr-007655
05:54:39.890 --> 05:54:40.910
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: baka 200B.

asr-007656
05:54:40.910 --> 05:54:43.530
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kung hindi man 300, at least 200.

asr-007657
05:54:44.130 --> 05:54:46.090
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero kung na rin, dapat mapush.

asr-007658
05:54:46.090 --> 05:54:51.390
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So I'd like to thank Sen Pia for always bringing this topic up.

asr-007659
05:54:52.650 --> 05:54:53.070
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Thank you.

asr-007660
05:54:53.070 --> 05:54:55.730
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-007661
05:54:57.190 --> 05:54:58.730
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Thank you for always supporting.

asr-007662
05:54:59.030 --> 05:55:01.310
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Sama-sama naman tayo dito sa advocacy natin.

asr-007663
05:55:01.690 --> 05:55:04.130
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Um, last few points.

asr-007664
05:55:04.150 --> 05:55:09.270
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Um, FDA, OIC, Atty. Tabakin,

asr-007665
05:55:09.270 --> 05:55:10.470
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I note that you're there.

asr-007666
05:55:10.470 --> 05:55:12.270
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I will address it to the Secretary, no?

asr-007667
05:55:12.270 --> 05:55:16.770
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because the FDA is still under the Department of Health.

asr-007668
05:55:16.770 --> 05:55:20.730
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But obviously, there is an OIC

asr-007669
05:55:20.730 --> 05:55:24.570
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: because it's your primary responsibility to handle it

asr-007670
05:55:24.570 --> 05:55:27.330
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: sa dami nang nasa ilalim ng DOH, no?

asr-007671
05:55:27.330 --> 05:55:32.130
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Are you familiar, Atty. Tabakin, with the vape epidemic?

asr-007672
05:55:32.130 --> 05:55:37.390
FDA OIC Director General Atty. Franklin Anthony M. Tabaquin IV: I'm fairly familiar.

asr-007673
05:55:37.390 --> 05:55:37.870
FDA OIC Director General Atty. Franklin Anthony M. Tabaquin IV: I'm fairly familiar.

asr-007674
05:55:37.870 --> 05:55:38.370
FDA OIC Director General Atty. Franklin Anthony M. Tabaquin IV: I'm fairly familiar.

asr-007675
05:55:38.370 --> 05:55:38.510
FDA OIC Director General Atty. Franklin Anthony M. Tabaquin IV: I'm fairly familiar.

asr-007676
05:55:38.530 --> 05:55:39.750
FDA OIC Director General Atty. Franklin Anthony M. Tabaquin IV: Fairly familiar, Your Honour.

asr-007677
05:55:39.750 --> 05:55:40.650
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Fairly.

asr-007678
05:55:40.650 --> 05:55:41.470
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: What do you know?

asr-007679
05:55:41.470 --> 05:55:42.510
FDA OIC Director General Atty. Franklin Anthony M. Tabaquin IV: Fairly familiar.

asr-007680
05:55:42.510 --> 05:55:45.570
FDA OIC Director General Atty. Franklin Anthony M. Tabaquin IV: I've heard, um,

asr-007681
05:55:45.570 --> 05:55:47.370
FDA OIC Director General Atty. Franklin Anthony M. Tabaquin IV: uh,

asr-007682
05:55:47.370 --> 05:55:51.350
FDA OIC Director General Atty. Franklin Anthony M. Tabaquin IV: what I know, Your Honour, is that we have already, um,

asr-007683
05:55:51.350 --> 05:55:53.850
FDA OIC Director General Atty. Franklin Anthony M. Tabaquin IV: uh, issued, uh,

asr-007684
05:55:53.850 --> 05:55:57.990
FDA OIC Director General Atty. Franklin Anthony M. Tabaquin IV: or are in the process of, um, crafting a policy on,

asr-007685
05:55:57.990 --> 05:56:04.100
FDA OIC Director General Atty. Franklin Anthony M. Tabaquin IV: on, uh, regulation of, uh, vape products, Your Honour.

asr-007686
05:56:04.100 --> 05:56:06.880
FDA OIC Director General Atty. Franklin Anthony M. Tabaquin IV: ...

asr-007687
05:56:06.880 --> 05:56:13.920
FDA OIC Director General Atty. Franklin Anthony M. Tabaquin IV: ...

asr-007688
05:56:13.920 --> 05:56:19.080
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I'll just give you some very basic statistics, Mr.

asr-007689
05:56:19.080 --> 05:56:21.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Attorney, uh, Tabakin.

asr-007690
05:56:21.620 --> 05:56:26.100
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Uh, the e-cigarette and vaping prevalence in the country

asr-007691
05:56:26.100 --> 05:56:29.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: among adolescents, uh, aged 10 to 19 years old,

asr-007692
05:56:29.600 --> 05:56:35.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: in 2015, it was 0.8%, not even 1%, engaged in vaping.

asr-007693
05:56:35.820 --> 05:56:37.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: ...

asr-007694
05:56:37.020 --> 05:56:38.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Not even 1%.

asr-007695
05:56:38.580 --> 05:56:44.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: In 2023, the number is staggering, 39.9%.

asr-007696
05:56:44.220 --> 05:56:46.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: 40%, basically.

asr-007697
05:56:46.380 --> 05:56:47.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: By 2026, it will be higher.

asr-007698
05:56:47.920 --> 05:56:54.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I'm not aware that any of our policies have made a significant impact in intervening.

asr-007699
05:56:55.060 --> 05:56:58.000
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And I want to give you a very quick history, Atty. Tabakin.

asr-007700
05:56:58.240 --> 05:57:01.440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You can do the research and fill in the gaps.

asr-007701
05:57:02.220 --> 05:57:03.460
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But it's very simple.

asr-007702
05:57:03.460 --> 05:57:07.280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Vaping is the new product of the tobacco industry.

asr-007703
05:57:07.520 --> 05:57:12.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: In the 1960s, the tobacco industry used actors in white lab coats

asr-007704
05:57:12.140 --> 05:57:17.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: to make it appear that certain kinds of cigarettes, including menthol cigarettes, were healthier.

asr-007705
05:57:17.060 --> 05:57:19.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And they specifically targeted women.

asr-007706
05:57:20.280 --> 05:57:21.760
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So this is well-documented.

asr-007707
05:57:22.100 --> 05:57:23.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And there are a lot of balls there.

asr-007708
05:57:23.540 --> 05:57:26.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So now that very same playlist is being used for vapes.

asr-007709
05:57:27.560 --> 05:57:33.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: In fact, we had to push so hard to ensure that we had policies that prevent doctors

asr-007710
05:57:33.180 --> 05:57:33.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: from...

asr-007711
05:57:33.460 --> 05:57:35.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: advocating for vapes.

asr-007712
05:57:35.340 --> 05:57:37.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because the law now that we have, which is a very weakened law,

asr-007713
05:57:38.260 --> 05:57:42.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: our syntax law, again, sorry to lecture, but this is my baby.

asr-007714
05:57:42.660 --> 05:57:47.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And 40% of our youth now is vaping.

asr-007715
05:57:49.020 --> 05:57:55.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: In the syntax law, which we passed, we said that we lowered the age of access to...

asr-007716
05:57:55.800 --> 05:57:58.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Sorry, we increased the age of access to 21 years old.

asr-007717
05:57:58.520 --> 05:57:59.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because the brain is still developing.

asr-007718
05:58:00.180 --> 05:58:02.840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So we said, not even 18, we make it 21 years old.

asr-007719
05:58:02.840 --> 05:58:07.100
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then we made it very clear that the jurisdiction is with the FDA.

asr-007720
05:58:07.800 --> 05:58:09.360
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And the third is we banned flavors.

asr-007721
05:58:09.680 --> 05:58:14.440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because flavors makes it enticing to not just the youth, but even to adults.

asr-007722
05:58:14.440 --> 05:58:17.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So allowed lang doon is menthol and then tobacco flavor.

asr-007723
05:58:17.800 --> 05:58:18.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That's it.

asr-007724
05:58:18.880 --> 05:58:21.280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Shortly after that, barely a year.

asr-007725
05:58:22.000 --> 05:58:23.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I'm asking for a year.

asr-007726
05:58:24.880 --> 05:58:31.100
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So the syntax law was passed in January 22, 2020, because we passed the bill,

asr-007727
05:58:31.200 --> 05:58:32.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: but it became a law in January.

asr-007728
05:58:32.840 --> 05:58:37.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then barely a year and a half later,

asr-007729
05:58:37.460 --> 05:58:41.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: they passed the vape law that overturned those very important provisions.

asr-007730
05:58:42.320 --> 05:58:43.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Where did the country see it?

asr-007731
05:58:43.600 --> 05:58:45.000
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: The youth was protected.

asr-007732
05:58:45.280 --> 05:58:47.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Their access was made 21 years old.

asr-007733
05:58:47.260 --> 05:58:48.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: They were put under 18.

asr-007734
05:58:48.980 --> 05:58:49.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It's embarrassing.

asr-007735
05:58:49.960 --> 05:58:52.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: For all the accomplishments, our hardworking diplomats do,

asr-007736
05:58:53.020 --> 05:58:58.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: WHO, they look up to the Philippines because we do so much good work in paper,

asr-007737
05:58:59.280 --> 05:59:01.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: in advocacy, and then here we are.

asr-007738
05:59:01.140 --> 05:59:02.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: We increased the age.

asr-007739
05:59:02.840 --> 05:59:04.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: We lowered the age to 18.

asr-007740
05:59:04.820 --> 05:59:07.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then the jurisdiction was transferred to DTI.

asr-007741
05:59:07.800 --> 05:59:14.440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then the flavors, although it is couched in words that appear to be prohibitive of flavors,

asr-007742
05:59:14.440 --> 05:59:18.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: but the fact that you open the door, you open it a crack, you open it up,

asr-007743
05:59:18.780 --> 05:59:20.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and now all kinds of flavors are available.

asr-007744
05:59:20.820 --> 05:59:25.500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And we try to work with DTI to prevent the sale of these products online,

asr-007745
05:59:25.660 --> 05:59:27.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: but they are prevalent online.

asr-007746
05:59:27.400 --> 05:59:28.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Anyway, that's the history.

asr-007747
05:59:29.720 --> 05:59:31.280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: What is the challenge we face now?

asr-007748
05:59:31.820 --> 05:59:32.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: DTI will say,

asr-007749
05:59:32.840 --> 05:59:33.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: that they have the jurisdiction,

asr-007750
05:59:34.580 --> 05:59:36.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: but if you look at the mandate of DTI,

asr-007751
05:59:37.100 --> 05:59:43.500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: is there anything in DTI's mandate that says that they have any expertise in health?

asr-007752
05:59:44.160 --> 05:59:44.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Any.

asr-007753
05:59:45.340 --> 05:59:46.240
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: There is none.

asr-007754
05:59:47.740 --> 05:59:50.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, the exact wording of the law,

asr-007755
05:59:50.540 --> 05:59:54.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: although to me it's not strong enough because I did not want DTI to have any jurisdiction,

asr-007756
05:59:54.460 --> 05:59:57.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: it says that it will work with FDA.

asr-007757
05:59:58.180 --> 05:59:59.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And I will read the exact wording to you.

asr-007758
06:00:02.900 --> 06:00:11.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It says, the DTI, in consultation with FDA, shall set technical standards for safety, consistency, and quality of the products requiring registration.

asr-007759
06:00:12.060 --> 06:00:13.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, this is required of FDA.

asr-007760
06:00:13.860 --> 06:00:21.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, if you're telling me that you're working on this, just goes to show how strong the tobacco and the vape lobby is in this country.

asr-007761
06:00:21.120 --> 06:00:24.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because 2022 pa na pa sa yan, and then we are still working on this.

asr-007762
06:00:30.350 --> 06:00:32.350
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, I want everybody to let that sink in.

asr-007763
06:00:32.350 --> 06:00:40.290
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Diba, trabaho tayo ng trabaho, papa-increase natin yung support natin through ZBB or whatever.

asr-007764
06:00:41.570 --> 06:00:47.870
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: This has a pulmonary effect on the health of people, and there are documented cases of people dying.

asr-007765
06:00:49.910 --> 06:00:59.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, if you ask me, because the mandate of FDA and DOH is health, you can take a more proactive step.

asr-007766
06:01:00.200 --> 06:01:01.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You can volunteer your services.

asr-007767
06:01:02.080 --> 06:01:03.460
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because every year, I ask them.

asr-007768
06:01:03.460 --> 06:01:06.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Wala daw silang machine to test the FDA products.

asr-007769
06:01:07.620 --> 06:01:21.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: When this law was being debated, the vape law, which I vehemently oppose because it is a watered-down version of the syntax provisions that we had.

asr-007770
06:01:23.040 --> 06:01:31.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I pointed out that in the U.S., 55,000 flavors were disallowed in 2022.

asr-007771
06:01:31.140 --> 06:01:32.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But guess what?

asr-007772
06:01:32.660 --> 06:01:39.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Nung niresearch ko ulit, because I had another hearing lately, I was so shocked, and I'm asking my staff to pull it out.

asr-007773
06:01:39.220 --> 06:01:39.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I was so shocked.

asr-007774
06:01:40.360 --> 06:01:41.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That number like tripled.

asr-007775
06:01:41.820 --> 06:01:48.240
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Like, hundreds of thousands of flavors in the U.S.A. were disallowed because these are chemicals that are put in the…

asr-007776
06:01:48.240 --> 06:01:50.520
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yung kalaban mo sa sigarilyo, at least alam mo, tobacco.

asr-007777
06:01:50.760 --> 06:01:52.280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Alam mo na yun, yung ill effects ng tobacco.

asr-007778
06:01:52.420 --> 06:01:57.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Ito, various chemicals because all the different flavors have different chemicals in it, and so on and so forth.

asr-007779
06:01:57.780 --> 06:02:00.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Dito sa Philippines, tinatanong ko, ilan ang naban natin?

asr-007780
06:02:01.980 --> 06:02:02.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Ilan?

asr-007781
06:02:02.660 --> 06:02:03.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Wala.

asr-007782
06:02:06.050 --> 06:02:08.490
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So that's where we are, Mr. Chairman.

asr-007783
06:02:09.430 --> 06:02:10.830
