asr-007965
06:12:25.940 --> 06:12:30.540
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: I think we really need to have a separate group really thinking of the future.

asr-007966
06:12:30.880 --> 06:12:32.560
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Because we are...

asr-007967
06:12:32.560 --> 06:12:33.640
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: We are...

asr-007968
06:12:33.640 --> 06:12:35.440
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pabaksin kami on the day-to-day.

asr-007969
06:12:35.820 --> 06:12:37.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And that is the purpose of the futures thinking office.

asr-007970
06:12:38.100 --> 06:12:39.080
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yun lang yung gagawin niya.

asr-007971
06:12:39.600 --> 06:12:40.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Isipin yung future.

asr-007972
06:12:40.800 --> 06:12:41.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So while you're thinking na,

asr-007973
06:12:42.320 --> 06:12:44.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Eto, I have to deal with leptospirosis.

asr-007974
06:12:44.620 --> 06:12:45.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But somebody is going to tell you,

asr-007975
06:12:46.180 --> 06:12:48.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Mr. Secretary, 10 years from now, ito lang.

asr-007976
06:12:48.140 --> 06:12:50.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: In fact, 10 years is not even considered futures thinking.

asr-007977
06:12:51.060 --> 06:12:52.280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Talagang the next generation.

asr-007978
06:12:52.760 --> 06:12:53.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Two generations away.

asr-007979
06:12:53.820 --> 06:12:55.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So that's where you make...

asr-007980
06:12:55.940 --> 06:12:58.660
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Decisions between plastic and organic.

asr-007981
06:12:58.960 --> 06:13:04.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You know, the long-term investments in what we eat, what we put in our mouth, what we put on our skin.

asr-007982
06:13:05.280 --> 06:13:06.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I think this is my last concern.

asr-007983
06:13:07.600 --> 06:13:09.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Alam to ng mga colleagues namin.

asr-007984
06:13:10.160 --> 06:13:12.060
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Pero hindi ko pa ito na banggit sa iyo, Secretary.

asr-007985
06:13:14.200 --> 06:13:14.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Ah!

asr-007986
06:13:19.390 --> 06:13:26.570
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: The Senate recently passed the anti-hospital detention bill.

asr-007987
06:13:26.570 --> 06:13:28.050
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And a provision is there.

asr-007988
06:13:28.690 --> 06:13:29.490
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: On my...

asr-007989
06:13:29.490 --> 06:13:33.110
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: MyFIP covering the balance with every hospital.

asr-007990
06:13:33.510 --> 06:13:40.970
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You may want to look into what is that number for MyFIP to cover that.

asr-007991
06:13:41.130 --> 06:13:44.550
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because MyFIP is highly controversial.

asr-007992
06:13:45.030 --> 06:13:48.090
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Some people want legislators to include it.

asr-007993
06:13:48.190 --> 06:13:50.530
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Some people don't want legislators to include it.

asr-007994
06:13:50.890 --> 06:13:52.330
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So you have to guide us.

asr-007995
06:13:52.390 --> 06:13:54.870
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because if that law passes, it passed us.

asr-007996
06:13:54.870 --> 06:13:56.030
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Pero it's a matter of time.

asr-007997
06:13:56.910 --> 06:13:58.270
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I think the House has a version.

asr-007998
06:13:59.330 --> 06:13:59.450
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yeah.

asr-007999
06:13:59.490 --> 06:14:00.990
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So it might become...

asr-008000
06:14:00.990 --> 06:14:01.970
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Baka mag-buy-cum lang sila.

asr-008001
06:14:02.050 --> 06:14:04.310
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: If that provision stays, may impact yan sa inyo.

asr-008002
06:14:04.690 --> 06:14:08.410
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So you'll have to tell us ano yung MyFIP amount na kailangan.

asr-008003
06:14:08.410 --> 06:14:10.250
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kasi ang hirap nagtatalo kami.

asr-008004
06:14:10.430 --> 06:14:16.630
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Tapos meron tayong hindi na consider na pagkukuhaan ng MyFIP na by law.

asr-008005
06:14:17.210 --> 06:14:19.070
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Pinayagan natin, nilagay doon.

asr-008006
06:14:20.070 --> 06:14:21.290
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It was an amendment made.

asr-008007
06:14:21.970 --> 06:14:22.930
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So nandun yun.

asr-008008
06:14:23.590 --> 06:14:24.450
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Not by me.

asr-008009
06:14:24.630 --> 06:14:27.450
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But it's an amendment that passed in the Senate.

asr-008010
06:14:27.670 --> 06:14:27.770
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay?

asr-008011
06:14:28.370 --> 06:14:29.410
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then finally...

asr-008012
06:14:29.490 --> 06:14:30.950
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Final point on MyFIP.

asr-008013
06:14:33.990 --> 06:14:36.370
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: In a utopian world, walang MyFIP sana.

asr-008014
06:14:36.710 --> 06:14:42.670
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So even me as a senator, it's added work for my staff to have to receive these requests

asr-008015
06:14:42.670 --> 06:14:44.170
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: and then to have to forward it.

asr-008016
06:14:44.410 --> 06:14:45.910
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But we try our best to help you.

asr-008017
06:14:46.010 --> 06:14:48.390
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because hindi namin ipo-forward yung mukhang kalukuhan din.

asr-008018
06:14:48.550 --> 06:14:49.730
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kasi ayaw naman natin yan.

asr-008019
06:14:49.890 --> 06:14:53.490
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So tinatry din namin ma-filter yun bago ma-recommend sa inyo.

asr-008020
06:14:53.490 --> 06:14:57.530
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Well, for the information of the public, which I've said in another venue,

asr-008021
06:14:57.650 --> 06:14:58.550
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: but my colleagues know,

asr-008022
06:14:58.550 --> 06:14:59.550
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: me, my brother...

asr-008023
06:15:00.000 --> 06:15:06.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And I think all the members of the minority are now, our recommendations are no longer accepted by DOH.

asr-008024
06:15:07.340 --> 06:15:12.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So that to me is a very politicized step taken by who, I don't know.

asr-008025
06:15:13.080 --> 06:15:16.120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I'm letting you know because my question is why?

asr-008026
06:15:16.120 --> 06:15:24.000
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Are the people who go to us and ask for assistance less Filipinos than the other Filipinos who go to a senator who's in the administration?

asr-008027
06:15:24.140 --> 06:15:26.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I don't even ask them to go to me, but they will go to me.

asr-008028
06:15:26.220 --> 06:15:35.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That's why I need to put something in there for you that I've never seen, I've never touched, but I want them to be able to access it.

asr-008029
06:15:35.340 --> 06:15:37.700
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then now, we can't recommend anymore.

asr-008030
06:15:39.060 --> 06:15:42.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Has anything changed? Has anything changed in our ability to recommend?

asr-008031
06:15:43.260 --> 06:15:52.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I don't know if I have one or two staff who dedicate their time to help filter that so that we can help them, how to ask for assistance, and if it's not enough, it looks bogus.

asr-008032
06:15:52.020 --> 06:15:55.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: We don't recommend it to reduce your burden.

asr-008033
06:15:56.220 --> 06:16:03.520
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But letting you know that that's what we did because we're in the minority, and I'd like to think it doesn't prevent me from doing my job well.

asr-008034
06:16:04.020 --> 06:16:15.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I'm here to support the budget of DOH, so I hope you'll also support that because let's not allow our alignments to be politicized.

asr-008035
06:16:15.180 --> 06:16:19.500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Did I say anything here that is unfair to the administration?

asr-008036
06:16:19.780 --> 06:16:20.440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I don't think so.

asr-008037
06:16:20.800 --> 06:16:24.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I mentioned the policies I'm concerned about regardless of who is sitting there.

asr-008038
06:16:24.420 --> 06:16:26.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I don't make any personal attacks.

asr-008039
06:16:26.260 --> 06:16:29.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, it's embarrassing for our constituents to ask for help from us.

asr-008040
06:16:30.720 --> 06:16:33.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, I'm letting you know that that is our situation.

asr-008041
06:16:34.200 --> 06:16:34.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-008042
06:16:35.100 --> 06:16:38.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I do have more, but I will deliver it to you individually.

asr-008043
06:16:38.180 --> 06:16:49.940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I wanted to, but my staff told me, Mr. Chairman, that you said, I wanted to give time to the heads of every specialty hospital to do two things.

asr-008044
06:16:50.120 --> 06:16:54.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: One is to monitor their accomplishments for the year.

asr-008045
06:16:54.820 --> 06:16:55.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then,

asr-008046
06:16:56.220 --> 06:17:04.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: to tell them what their biggest need is because we tasked them also with developing more specialty centers in the regions.

asr-008047
06:17:04.280 --> 06:17:05.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, I wanted to hear from that.

asr-008048
06:17:06.120 --> 06:17:07.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I do have another appointment.

asr-008049
06:17:07.640 --> 06:17:08.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I won't be able to.

asr-008050
06:17:09.000 --> 06:17:20.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: If you call on them, I will listen, and I will support with the chairman's consent, of course, priority projects that they have because they've always done a good job.

asr-008051
06:17:20.260 --> 06:17:22.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, thank you, everyone, for all your hard work.

asr-008052
06:17:23.060 --> 06:17:23.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Thank you.

asr-008053
06:17:23.640 --> 06:17:26.100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Senator Pia, probably before you go.

asr-008054
06:17:26.220 --> 06:17:30.300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Maybe that's a concern for the GOCC specialty hospitals.

asr-008055
06:17:31.840 --> 06:17:35.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: You have subsidy reductions.

asr-008056
06:17:36.440 --> 06:17:48.780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Probably, we can ask the four to quickly, the four specialty hospitals that received lower 2027 NEP appropriations than their 2026 levels.

asr-008057
06:17:49.140 --> 06:17:54.240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Of course, Lung Center, NKTI, PCMC, and Philippine Heart Center.

asr-008058
06:17:54.240 --> 06:17:54.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay.

asr-008059
06:17:54.740 --> 06:17:55.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So,

asr-008060
06:17:56.220 --> 06:18:14.780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Maybe, quickly, can we, what services, projects, maybe, I want to ask you, Senator, in case your programs or services, projects, or any support, patient, indigent patient support that will be affected by these lower subsidies, we can probably augment, right?

asr-008061
06:18:15.000 --> 06:18:18.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Maybe, we can start with, who can start?

asr-008062
06:18:19.840 --> 06:18:25.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: NKTI, Executive Director, Ose Dante Dator.

asr-008063
06:18:25.420 --> 06:18:26.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sir, you have the floor.

asr-008064
06:18:26.220 --> 06:18:42.920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Let us know how much your reduction in subsidy, and then which services will be affected, and what services you need, how much would you need, at least, so that these services and other programs will not be affected.

asr-008065
06:18:43.620 --> 06:18:46.460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Good afternoon, Mr. Chair, Your Honor, Senator Pia.

asr-008066
06:18:46.560 --> 06:18:47.160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Good afternoon.

asr-008067
06:18:48.240 --> 06:18:54.980
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: Actually, the subsidy that was given to NKTI for 2027.

asr-008068
06:18:55.560 --> 06:18:56.160
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: If you will look.

asr-008069
06:18:56.220 --> 06:19:03.440
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: At the actual comparison of 2026, 2027, there was an addition, and this was meant for special projects.

asr-008070
06:19:03.440 --> 06:19:25.540
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: And those special projects are currently ongoing, and these are for our expanded outpatient facility building, additional QFS, for increasing number of patients that we are servicing now, with the onset of the zero balance billing that ever since it started, about 11 months ago.

asr-008071
06:19:25.540 --> 06:19:25.560
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: 11 months ago.

asr-008072
06:19:25.560 --> 06:19:35.240
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: We have already given 72,015 patients to the tune of 1.585 billion.

asr-008073
06:19:35.240 --> 06:19:41.400
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: So, that addition in 2026 was not included anymore in 2027.

asr-008074
06:19:41.980 --> 06:19:54.920
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: And therefore, the actual subsidy that will be given to us is enough to cover the remaining QFS for the subsequent year.

asr-008075
06:19:54.920 --> 06:19:54.980
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: Okay.

asr-008076
06:19:55.560 --> 06:19:56.000
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: So, that's the first part.

asr-008077
06:19:56.000 --> 06:20:13.760
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: And then, in addition, we were asked to propose additional subsidies, and this will be the major accomplishments or major programs that we intend to finish by the last part of 2027 or early 2028.

asr-008078
06:20:13.760 --> 06:20:25.260
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: And this, for the information of everybody, this was the recently announced legacy building, which will complete the phase four of the 2027.

asr-008079
06:20:25.560 --> 06:20:29.800
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: Which is 300 hemodialysis beds, which are now in the phase three.

asr-008080
06:20:29.800 --> 06:20:37.600
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: The phase four request will be the completion, which will be now up to the corporate operating budget of NKTI.

asr-008081
06:20:38.480 --> 06:20:54.680
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: Then, we will convert some of our doctor's clinics to the additional 50 to 60 beds to augment our existing bed capacity, which on any day is almost 100 to 110%.

asr-008082
06:20:54.680 --> 06:20:55.120
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: Okay.

asr-008083
06:20:55.560 --> 06:21:19.200
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: And in order to bridge the gap, we are actually converting some of our private rooms, splitting them into two or three to be able to accommodate the service or ward accommodation so that we can accommodate those requesting for ZBB, MyEPIP, PhilHealth, and QFS.

asr-008084
06:21:19.200 --> 06:21:31.920
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: So our actual bed capacity, which is 370, if I will make a count after we increase the conversion of our patient rooms, will actually be closer to 400.

asr-008085
06:21:32.520 --> 06:21:41.840
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: And therefore, those are the requests, an additional 300 for our doctor's clinic and conversion of doctor's clinic, another 250 million.

asr-008086
06:21:42.240 --> 06:21:46.980
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: But that is not in the submitted national expenditure program.

asr-008087
06:21:46.980 --> 06:21:48.980
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: So this is...

asr-008088
06:21:49.200 --> 06:21:53.640
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: Where the position of the NKTI is for the 2027 budget.

asr-008089
06:21:54.120 --> 06:21:54.920
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: Thank you, Your Honor.

asr-008090
06:21:56.340 --> 06:22:00.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, please put that in writing for at least what you mentioned also.

asr-008091
06:22:01.940 --> 06:22:03.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: That you would...

asr-008092
06:22:03.420 --> 06:22:09.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: In order for us to be able to justify, in case we will make the necessary augmentation,

asr-008093
06:22:09.420 --> 06:22:18.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: the implementation of zero-balance billing and accommodation for PhilHealth and what else?

asr-008094
06:22:18.820 --> 06:22:19.180
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: Addiction.

asr-008095
06:22:19.200 --> 06:22:20.320
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: Additional patients for the...

asr-008096
06:22:20.320 --> 06:22:21.340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Additional patients.

asr-008097
06:22:21.980 --> 06:22:24.420
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: Hemodialysis, which is mostly outpatient.

asr-008098
06:22:25.420 --> 06:22:25.700
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: But...

asr-008099
06:22:25.700 --> 06:22:30.300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: For the fact, you are always at 110% capacity, right?

asr-008100
06:22:30.300 --> 06:22:34.300
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: Sir, that is why it is always said that our emergency room is full.

asr-008101
06:22:34.780 --> 06:22:40.520
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: Even without the leptospirosis, for which we have been accommodating all the complicated ones, the severe ones,

asr-008102
06:22:40.880 --> 06:22:44.220
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: 90% of the leptospirosis patient goes to the NKTI.

asr-008103
06:22:44.220 --> 06:22:48.180
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: But on any given day, year in, year out,

asr-008104
06:22:48.180 --> 06:22:53.900
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: majority of the patients in the emergency room are patients who had complications

asr-008105
06:22:53.900 --> 06:23:00.600
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: undergoing hemodialysis, peritoneal dialysis, and kidney transplant, all across the NCR.

asr-008106
06:23:01.100 --> 06:23:03.000
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: We will put that in writing, Your Honor.

asr-008107
06:23:03.920 --> 06:23:06.320
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: By next week, it will be submitted to your officer.

asr-008108
06:23:06.700 --> 06:23:07.480
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: Okay, thank you.

asr-008109
06:23:08.040 --> 06:23:08.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Mr. Chairman.

asr-008110
06:23:08.740 --> 06:23:09.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yes, Mr. Dekitan.

asr-008111
06:23:09.580 --> 06:23:13.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I just want to say, because you mentioned the decrease in their budget.

asr-008112
06:23:13.640 --> 06:23:15.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That's from NEP to GAAP.

asr-008113
06:23:15.440 --> 06:23:17.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But their NEP to NEP is...

asr-008114
06:23:18.180 --> 06:23:22.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: The reason why their GAAP is higher is because we are the ones who paid for it.

asr-008115
06:23:23.520 --> 06:23:24.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You know that.

asr-008116
06:23:24.540 --> 06:23:25.340
NKTI Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante P. Dator: Thank you, Your Honor.

asr-008117
06:23:25.600 --> 06:23:26.240
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You're welcome.

asr-008118
06:23:27.140 --> 06:23:30.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: NKTI, we increased your budget by 1.9 billion.

asr-008119
06:23:30.220 --> 06:23:31.700
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Hospital services, 1 billion.

asr-008120
06:23:31.960 --> 06:23:34.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Construction of outpatient services, 500 million.

asr-008121
06:23:36.300 --> 06:23:38.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Procurement of linear accelerator, 400 million.

asr-008122
06:23:39.100 --> 06:23:40.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, 1.9.

asr-008123
06:23:40.040 --> 06:23:45.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And all the other specialty hospitals, we did the same for you.

asr-008124
06:23:46.000 --> 06:23:47.440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, I hope, Mr. Chairman.

asr-008125
06:23:48.180 --> 06:23:54.600
